> world import crates/content/tests/fixtures/azgaar/raster.json target/raster.map
imported Raster into raster.map: 40 × 40 tiles in 1 × 1 chunks, 357 ocean, 174 lake and 1069 land; heights -176.70 to 1922.19 m; 4046 bytes
> world info target/raster.map
raster.map: 40 × 40 tiles in 1 × 1 chunks, 0 overrides; 4046 bytes
recipe: source fnv1a64:bdb2047d2fea3e94, source pixels (0, 0) to (39, 39), 1 tile a source pixel, seed 0; detail 0.25 of the relief, 8.00 pixels, 4 octaves; shallows to 10.00 metres, specks under 4 tiles
> assert world import crates/content/tests/fixtures/azgaar/raster.json target/off.map --region 30,30,20,20 == error: the region runs off the source map: pixels (30, 30) to (49, 49), and the map is 40 × 40 pixels
> assert world import crates/content/tests/fixtures/azgaar/raster.json target/off.map --region 10,10 == error: --region needs four whole numbers, <x>,<y>,<width>,<height>, not 10,10
> assert world import crates/content/tests/fixtures/azgaar/raster.json == error: world needs the form: world info <file>, world source <file>, or world import <export> <map> [--region <x>,<y>,<width>,<height>] [--scale <n>] [--seed <n>] [--detail <strength>] [--wavelength <pixels>] [--octaves <n>] [--shallows <metres>] [--specks <tiles>]
