imported Raster into rough.map: 40 × 40 tiles in 1 × 1 chunks, 299 ocean, 181 lake and 1120 land; heights -381.73 to 2241.02 m; 4642 bytes
> world info target/rough.map
rough.map: 40 × 40 tiles in 1 × 1 chunks, 0 overrides; 4642 bytes
recipe: source fnv1a64:bdb2047d2fea3e94, source pixels (0, 0) to (39, 39), 1 tile a source pixel, seed 3; detail 0.50 of the relief, 4.00 pixels, 2 octaves; shallows to 10.00 metres, specks under 4 tiles
> assert world import crates/content/tests/fixtures/azgaar/raster.json target/rough.map --octaves 9 == error: the detail needs 1 to 8 octaves, not 9
